  "files": [
    {
      "path": "chat-conversation.html",
      "type": "html",
      "content": "<!-- Chat Conversation — restored with its own scoped theme, incl. the blue token chips and warm code-block palette -->\n<style>\n  .acc-root {\n    --bg-surface-raised: #ffffff; --bg-hover: rgba(0,0,0,.04); --border-color: rgba(0,0,0,.08);\n    --text-primary: #171717; --text-secondary: #555555; --text-muted: #999999;\n    --token-blue-bg: rgba(59,130,246,.1); --token-blue-fg: #2563eb;\n    --code-bg: #f8f9fa; --code-border: #e2e8f0; --user-bubble-bg: #e8e8ec;\n  }\n  .dark .acc-root {\n    --bg-surface-raised: #222222; --bg-hover: rgba(255,255,255,.04); --border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.07);\n    --text-primary: #e8e8e8; --text-secondary: #999999; --text-muted: #555555;\n    --token-blue-bg: rgba(147,180,252,.12); --token-blue-fg: #8eaadc;\n    --code-bg: #1a1a1a; --code-border: rgba(255,255,255,.08); --user-bubble-bg: #2a2a2a;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"acc-root flex h-[800px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--bg-surface-raised)]\">\n  <div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col\">\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--border-color)] px-6 py-3\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--bg-hover)] text-[11px] font-semibold text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">AI</span>\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">JWT Token Refresh Design</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Active session · 4 messages</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-color)] px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">\n        <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z\" /><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\" /></svg>\n        Artifact Panel\n      </span>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Thread -->\n    <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-8 py-6\">\n      <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-2xl flex-col gap-6\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[var(--border-color)]\"></div>\n          <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Today</span>\n          <div class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[var(--border-color)]\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- User message -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-end gap-1.5\">\n          <div class=\"mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n            <span class=\"rounded-md bg-[var(--token-blue-bg)] px-2 py-0.5 text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--token-blue-fg)]\">auth-service.ts</span>\n            <span class=\"rounded-md bg-[var(--token-blue-bg)] px-2 py-0.5 text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--token-blue-fg)]\">middleware.ts</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl bg-[var(--user-bubble-bg)] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-primary)]\">\n            <span class=\"font-medium text-[var(--token-blue-fg)]\">@agent</span> Can you review these auth files? The JWT refresh logic seems broken — tokens expire but the middleware doesn't catch it.\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-1 text-[10.5px] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">10:15 AM</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Assistant message -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--bg-hover)] text-[11px] font-semibold text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">A</span>\n          <div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-3\">\n            <p class=\"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-primary)]\">Looking into the auth files now. Let me read through the code and trace the token refresh flow.</p>\n\n            <!-- Tool calls (default open) -->\n            <div class=\"rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-color)] bg-[var(--bg-surface-raised)] p-2.5 text-[12px]\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[var(--text-muted)]\">\n                <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 rotate-90\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 18l6-6-6-6\" /></svg>\n                <span class=\"font-medium\">3 tool calls executed</span>\n                <span class=\"ml-auto text-[10px]\">203ms</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-1.5 border-t border-[var(--border-color)] pt-2 font-mono text-[11.5px] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-green-500\">✓</span> <span>read</span> <span>auth-service.ts</span> <span class=\"ml-auto text-[10px]\">45ms</span></div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-green-500\">✓</span> <span>read</span> <span>middleware.ts</span> <span class=\"ml-auto text-[10px]\">38ms</span></div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-green-500\">✓</span> <span>bash</span> <span>grep -rn \"refreshToken\" src/</span> <span class=\"ml-auto text-[10px]\">120ms</span></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-primary)]\">\n              Found the issue. In <code class=\"rounded bg-[var(--bg-hover)] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px]\">middleware.ts</code>, token validation runs <strong class=\"font-semibold\">before</strong> the refresh check. When a token expires, the middleware rejects the request immediately instead of attempting a refresh.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Code block -->\n            <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[var(--code-border)] font-mono text-[12.5px]\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--code-border)] bg-[var(--bg-hover)] px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">\n                <span>middleware.ts</span>\n                <span>typescript</span>\n              </div>\n              <pre class=\"overflow-x-auto bg-[var(--code-bg)] p-3.5 leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-primary)]\"><code>async function authMiddleware(req: Request) {\n  try {\n    const decoded = validateToken(req.headers.authorization);\n    req.user = decoded;\n  } catch (err) {\n    if (err instanceof TokenExpiredError) {\n      const refreshed = await refreshToken(req.cookies.refreshToken);\n      if (refreshed) {\n        req.user = refreshed.user;\n        return next(req);\n      }\n    }\n    return new Response('Unauthorized', { status: 401 });\n  }\n  return next(req);\n}</code></pre>\n            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-color)] bg-[var(--bg-surface-raised)] p-3 text-left shadow-sm\">\n              <span class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--bg-hover)]\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z\" /><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\" /></svg></span>\n                <span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">\n                  <span class=\"block text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">JWT Token Refresh: Design &amp; Rollout</span>\n                  <span class=\"block text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Document · Click to view</span>\n                </span>\n              </span>\n            </span>\n\n            <span class=\"text-[10.5px] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">10:15 AM · Agent</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Composer -->\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl shrink-0 px-4 pb-4 pt-2\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border-color)] bg-[var(--bg-surface-raised)]\">\n        <div class=\"px-3 py-3\">\n          <p class=\"text-[14px] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Ask anything...</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[var(--border-color)] px-3 pb-2 pt-1\">\n          <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-2 py-1 text-[12px] text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">Ask<svg class=\"h-3 w-3\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" /></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--bg-hover)] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">\n            <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7\" /></svg>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Artifact panel (open by default) -->\n  <div class=\"flex w-[440px] shrink-0 flex-col border-l border-[var(--border-color)]\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--border-color)] px-5 py-3\">\n      <div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2.5\">\n        <svg class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z\" /><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\" /></svg>\n        <div class=\"min-w-0\">\n          <h3 class=\"truncate text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">JWT Token Refresh: Design &amp; Rollout</h3>\n          <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Document · Updated just now</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"rounded border border-[var(--border-color)] px-2 py-1 text-[11px] text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">v2</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-6\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-[20px] font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">JWT Token Refresh: Design &amp; Rollout</h1>\n\n      <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">Our API gateway authenticates every request with a short-lived JWT access token. This document describes the silent-refresh flow we just shipped.</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">The Fix</h2>\n      <ul class=\"mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">\n        <li><strong class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">Transparent</strong> — valid sessions never see an interruption</li>\n        <li><strong class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">Safe</strong> — a missing or invalid refresh token still returns 401</li>\n        <li><strong class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">Cheap</strong> — refresh only runs on the expiry path</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">Testing Matrix</h2>\n      <table class=\"mt-2 w-full border-collapse text-[12.5px]\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr class=\"border-b border-[var(--border-color)]\">\n            <th class=\"py-1.5 pr-2 text-left font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">Scenario</th>\n            <th class=\"py-1.5 text-left font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">Result</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">\n          <tr class=\"border-b border-[var(--border-color)]\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Valid token</td><td class=\"py-1.5\">200 OK</td></tr>\n          <tr class=\"border-b border-[var(--border-color)]\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Expired, valid refresh</td><td class=\"py-1.5\">200 OK + new token</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Expired, invalid refresh</td><td class=\"py-1.5\">401</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
    }
  ]
}
